<title>USA: Moore Medical considers sale of company.</title>
<headline>Moore Medical considers sale of company.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRITAIN, Conn. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moore Medical Corp said Wednesday that it has begun to explore alternatives for enhancing shareholder value, including joint ventures or a possible sale of all or part of the company.</p>
<p>The company said it has hired the investment banking firm of Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co Inc to act as advisor in this process.</p>
<p>Moore Medical Corp is a national distributor and marketer of health-care products.</p>
